---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
The model the assistant uses: list the choices, or set one for every conversation. Hosted models need their key (`mxr llm key set`)

Usage: mxr assistant model [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  set   Use this model for the assistant's next message, in every conversation
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
